  "translation": "Today is Saturday. The weather is very good. I go out to play with my friend Xiao Ming. We first go to the park. There are many flowers and birds in the park. We can see flowers and birds. We walk around in the park, then sit on a chair to rest. Later, we go to a store. I ask Xiao Ming: 'What do you want to buy?' Xiao Ming says: 'I want to buy some fruit.' I ask: 'How much is the fruit?' A person says: 'Ten yuan.' Then we buy fruit and milk. The store still has many other things, but we don't buy them. At noon, we eat lunch at a restaurant. I eat a bun, and he eats noodles. After the meal, we go to see a movie. The movie is very good; we all like it very much. We come out of the cinema, and we go to a coffee shop to drink a cup of coffee. In the afternoon, we go home. I read a book at home, then go to sleep. In the evening, I have dinner with my family. Today is really happy; we all have a great time."
